{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "92fec2d47e8685d194b65265cec3ee8aa5dbd4060f73ab881ac2daa63237f75f", "ja": "ナイスでナースな役回り", "zh": "俏丽护士的角色分配", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1ac190a38fe11193cf2d12fc1aff3b206d5876fc1034c91cc4632f369b9d012e", "ja": "オーディション合格の報告に沸く未来たち。\n台本を受け取り、それぞれ配役を確認する。\n百合子は、念願の被害者役に大喜び。医師や\nナース役の志保や琴葉もまた、経験者の風花\nから話を聞いて演技に活かそうと張り切る。", "zh": "未来等人为通过试镜的消息欢呼雀跃。\n她们接过剧本，确认各自的角色分配。\n百合子如愿拿到梦寐以求的受害者一角，高兴不已。饰演医生和护士的志保、琴叶也干劲十足，向有相关经验的风花请教，打算将其运用到演技中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "e7db908d19e81f2686fca46449fd84463676627f35858f3616996321a0391a2e", "ja": "オーディションから1週間後……", "zh": "试镜后的第1周……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ef99398550df96743aa00f12453baa8068f84ed3a7bfc765753b3283f024a24e", "ja": "お疲れ様！\nオーディションの結果が届いたぞ。結果は……。", "zh": "辛苦了！\n试镜的结果送到了。结果是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b62432a6f75b715043e8f42aec84d8713caf40d0f64434980a678280f79a24b8", "ja": "全員、合格だ！\nおめでとう！", "zh": "所有人都合格了！\n恭喜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "39ef6daed2c8155f4445b102768678fd3243f0efce6a093b562b428aaad33abb", "ja": "やったぁ～！！\nよかったね、みんな！", "zh": "太好啦～！！\n太好了呢，大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e942a799067b42893bb6105bc1996b13a3bd81e48abd2af3c0d3d9b5d13ed09e", "ja": "今から台本を渡すから、確認してほしい。撮影が\n始まるまでに、各自しっかり読み込んでおいてくれ！", "zh": "我现在把剧本发给你们，请确认一下。在拍摄开始前，每个人都要好好熟悉剧本！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "2d897973fbfbe37695ebae08362833553c88525a92aaeea382ee9d5c07849566", "ja": "……はい。ありがとうございます！", "zh": "……好的。非常感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b73d107b8f0f7ab58028bcce36645e32ce403551e209203eec230971591b5097", "ja": "それと、雪歩とあずささんもキャスティングされた。\nみんなで現場を盛り上げような！", "zh": "还有，雪步和梓小姐也被选上了。\n我们一起把片场的气氛搞热闹起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "7af1fc7ac6fc7a9e1deb17c14de26803f5e2029aa9105cb0e5ed811e53ab18a0", "ja": "雪歩さんと、あずささんが……\n心強いですね。", "zh": "雪步和####也……\n真是令人安心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "48a8e7f1bb280d318e35276d9b8a6ff8950a73f97957a986cdb942b88bb76547", "ja": "あっ……琴葉ちゃん、見て！\nこの、登場人物のところ……。", "zh": "啊……琴叶，快看！\n这里写着登场人物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "c4982d5496dbb83ba5d6c55585f8c537d8557afb49b67299be6a37ffe78924c0", "ja": "え？　……あっ。\nこれ……もしかして、私が主演ですか！？", "zh": "咦？……啊。\n这个……难道说，主演是我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4058ac5a2689b8eed97af612daafb72fec63135b75daa8617a3a1be37d81876b", "ja": "犯人役だから、そういう事になる。\n頑張ろうな！", "zh": "因为是犯人角色，所以就是这么回事。一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "20aef160fddff6c89e458d205c39d528a438eb3cde743741c3c8e56c0b3c279d", "ja": "すごーい！　いいなぁ、琴葉ちゃん！\n……あれ？　もしかして、あんまりうれしくない？", "zh": "好厉害！真羡慕你啊，琴叶！\n……咦？难道你不是很开心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "9e856c49582db1c80c8177afcce4adaba40b44073edb093476fb2bdfb43af205", "ja": "そ、そんなことないよ！　ただ、コメディ作品で\n主演だなんて、実感が湧かなくて……。", "zh": "才、才不是那样！只是……要在喜剧作品里担任主演，总觉得还没有真实感……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3240d6aa0a6c3781726a91fd69a0dc2a7e0291d3a2f451c00a9207e03af68a25", "ja": "はは、撮影が始まれば、すぐに実感できるよ。\nあとはこの作品で新境地を開いてファンを……百合子？", "zh": "哈哈，等开拍之后，很快就能有实感了。接下来就要凭这部作品开拓新的境界，让粉丝……百合子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "87c4b06f6d0d122eb236e2eabe832ee64818253618d5a63bbc73d7d98645f3f4", "ja": "ひ、ひ、ひ……。", "zh": "咿、咿、咿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "315b162f8ec58d7d85209f88ea5d8542a134c8b6cfd8edfbcaeeb5d9da17469d", "ja": "ひ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "005472fad63d12f7c9c67d98010fa1bf494ecf5805860a94a1746ab1f2f57a04", "ja": "被害者役……！　私、被害者役です！\nついに、念願が叶いました……！", "zh": "受害者角色……！我要演受害者角色！\n终于，夙愿得偿了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4bbb874a62818c522f9312815c7efe5ab725ab5da918a995b38cf8c0356a4019", "ja": "えっ？　百合子ちゃん、そんなに\n被害者役がやりたかったんだ……？", "zh": "咦？百合子，你就那么想演受害者啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "0ed66465c4f4f88843a2e239bf76a5ecdec02407639232debd68eba63d6d21bb", "ja": "だって、すっごくおいしいじゃないですか！\n私、ずっとやってみたかったんです！", "zh": "因为，这可是非常抢眼的角色啊！\n我一直都很想试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "50c52447674dd8eb4ead5a62a70b29bdd8fad633424949594a554d63f99d8ead", "ja": "えっと、どんなふうに殺されちゃうんだろう？\nふむふむ、ほうほう……えっ、あっ、わぁっ！？", "zh": "那个，我会被怎么杀掉呢？\n嗯嗯，原来如此……诶、啊、哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "d99e43e4f82e8543c7091f4b84ae0cc9ee56473d46660af3e65ed400ef291986", "ja": "これは、想像以上の展開です！\nおいしすぎます～！", "zh": "这展开也太超乎想象了！实在太棒了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c85a8ca40e9e196fba4c2e7728b033c69c492241b02435d3b465e5135747d1b8", "ja": "そ、そうか、それはよかったな。\n他のみんなは、どうだ？", "zh": "这、这样啊，那太好了。\n其他人呢，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "6afb7242d5f4f110e81afd463a6d04739d013972140d3bdd40543c36a04ed0a5", "ja": "私は、新人ナース役です♪\n琴葉ちゃんと練習した、あの役ですね！", "zh": "我是新人护士的角色♪就是那个和琴叶酱一起练习过的角色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "7f7735d5fdd6941cc2d755b79c25d19f2a3880c1ab35ec491784aca2c661e96d", "ja": "私は、百合子さんと同じで被害者役ですね。\n医師で、風花さんの婚約者……えっ、婚約者！？", "zh": "我和百合子小姐一样，也是受害者的角色呢。\n是医生，也是风花小姐的未婚夫……咦，未婚夫！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "86502904b5f77721a24a496d10d60885e9119158bebdb369065cecb3044332ec", "ja": "うふふ、なんだか照れちゃうね。……あれ？\n私は同僚看護師なんだけど、被害者とも書いてあるね。", "zh": "呵呵，总觉得有点害羞呢。……咦？\n我是同事护士，不过上面好像也写着“被害者”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "ceb4a520c0ba8bc0a7903096293a6d8b774b21f95748f4ad30b26f9e60598ace", "ja": "私は、志保ちゃんが演じる医師の、元恋人……\nふたりに恨みを持っている、という設定みたいです。", "zh": "我是志保饰演的那位医生的前恋人……设定好像是对他们两人怀有怨恨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "16ee57f6c40e5a1c66746f841c77210a68ea6f9a73852898c23a944ded74a462", "ja": "たしかに、これは恨まれても仕方ありませんね。\nかなり遊んでいる人みたいですから……。", "zh": "确实，被怨恨也是情有可原呢。毕竟看起来是个相当花心的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "c0c7928e5bf9ad65cb08e6ab746679ba5d29f0dbd23917cff83d5cf050ea5c91", "ja": "あの、風花さん。\nこういうお医者さんって、実際にいるんですか？", "zh": "那个，风花小姐。\n现实中真有这样的医生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1028_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0a2f95d5b867b7de4a5adf1722b925d066f0ed792fbadfb5f890e90f7c40f031", "ja": "え、ええ！？　私の働いていた病院では、\nそういう話は聞かなかったけど……。", "zh": "诶、诶诶！？我以前工作的医院里，倒是没听说过这种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1029_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3a600537b180409aa7719f8f9c392fbe6e18a08c7de217806dec1d36817d6ce5", "ja": "お医者さんにもいろんな人がいるし、\nいないとは言いきれないかもだね……。", "zh": "医生也形形色色，或许也不能断言没有这种人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "f9cf6fa5ee775c74d1561ae8348216f3869c5dbc10cac3f2513fd33e054ad032", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、どうですか？\nもしいたら……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生怎么样？\n要是有的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "9fef67d1b658408817fa1b4f5d1c212184aa914cdcb8277cb5fd5a4a6665f674", "ja": "プレイボーイの知り合いか？\nうーん、思いつかないな……すまない。", "zh": "你认识花花公子吗？\n嗯……我想不起来有这样的熟人……抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "e5364bad8951311ee48adce3b92d7ccb6281cfdbb40a90cc057d9296cf2cb914", "ja": "たしかに……結構、レアなタイプなのかも？", "zh": "确实……或许是相当少见的类型？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "48fcb991b0fc2cf288b5dad4ffad20f6a1033e60ee26bb12bf38ac7d5b8a2c2e", "ja": "そうですか……。もし知り合いにいるのなら、\n役作りの参考にしたかったんですけど。", "zh": "这样啊……要是认识的人里有这种类型的话，本来还想拿来参考一下角色塑造的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1034_p", "source_sha256": "b30c1ea506d285128e7c49243b1d89abad6ef79b583023ff832d26dc9716d4a2", "ja": "い、いや、仮にいたとしても、大切なアイドルに\n近づけさせるわけにはいかないから……。", "zh": "不、不行，就算真有，我也不能\n让他接近我珍视的偶像啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "b47b74a4ebdf3615fe735310259006af436b3613c035115cde68aa7c32fb1ab4", "ja": "そうですよね……わかりました。\nモデル探しは諦めます。", "zh": "是啊……我明白了。\n我放弃找模特了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "00414683784bd66e4ac709900b1bb1abb720208f84805622812307198b56ad4f", "ja": "実在の人が無理なら、お話の登場人物を\n参考にすればいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "既然真人不行的话，那参考故事里的\n登场人物不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1037_026yur", "source_sha256": "6e4ad162331bca63efedddd4d8f31bd6f6cef19f7943df921ac89d3e8fe2a872", "ja": "フィクションでも、実在の人物がモデルに\nなっていることもあるだろうし。", "zh": "就算是虚构作品，也可能会有以现实人物为原型的角色吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "a783de2407f9ece1d56a910393a85050cd8df5bfd20f93983e06d08bab6bf49b", "ja": "うん、それが安全でいいと思う。\n百合子、心当たりはあるか？", "zh": "嗯，我觉得那样稳妥一些，挺好的。\n百合子，你有什么头绪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1039_026yur", "source_sha256": "2e447f317133428b9aba1e9604619414557a2903a25f4a697a973c1122e3c1f1", "ja": "はい！　なるべく、今回の役に近そうな\nキャラクターがいないか、探してみますね！", "zh": "好的！我会尽量找找看，有没有和这次的角色比较接近的角色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "1ddee3d0587d45424ca136faceb131c449aaf5f26edb94568260e1a06042e1db", "ja": "ありがとうございます、百合子さん。助かります。", "zh": "谢谢你，百合子。帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1041_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4954bcc3d225f35da3711bd4aabba69fe0dba150f272dcc44e3ed0833fd7558c", "ja": "私も、実際の病院の様子や、看護師に関わることなら\n協力できると思うから。何かあったら、聞いてね。", "zh": "我觉得如果是实际医院的情况，或者和护士有关的事情，我应该能帮上忙。要是有什么事，就来问我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1042_014mir", "source_sha256": "8deba9d5a8fe728582f6eee7bfb812b34601abc487ede8d2d0f6d4a2dfeaed38", "ja": "それなら私、聞きたいことがたくさんあるかも！", "zh": "那样的话，我可能有好多想问的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1043_017kth", "source_sha256": "05b54822f53b8a59962e0a8fd2bc4cff6b4b6654ccc760613ef67a0d1a6762fd", "ja": "私もです。質問をまとめておくので、\n風花さんの都合のいい時に、教えてください。", "zh": "我也是。我要把问题整理好，所以请在风花小姐方便的时候告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1044_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fdb1d1c3d2d1509ee92146a065b92fb523186b64d93fe2b28d72b9a0e7cf85dd", "ja": "うん、まかせて！　みんなで協力して、\nいい作品にしましょうね！", "zh": "嗯，包在我身上！大家一起齐心协力，\n做出一份好作品吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0316_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0316_story_04_1046_p", "source_sha256": "f2fb5787355a9934e9103cefb834996366e61649bc734761e4ab0ccca61fdae4", "ja": "（……？　志保、何か言いたそうだけど……\n何か気になってるのかな？）", "zh": "（……？志保好像有什么想说的……是有什么在意的事吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
